<title>USA: Marshall &amp; Ilsley unit completes purchase.</title>
<headline>Marshall &amp; Ilsley unit completes purchase.</headline>
<dateline>MILWAUKEE, Wis. 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>M&amp;I Data Services, a subsidiary of Marshall &amp; Ilsley Corp, said Thursday it completed the acquisition of EastPoint Technology Inc, a software development company specializing in client/server technology. Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>EastPoint, based in Bedford, N.H., has projected 1996 revenues of $5.3 million.</p>
<p>The market EastPoint serves has an estimated potential of more than $300 million in annual revenues.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
